# =============================================================================
# texas-turnout-scraper — project-specific (read before editing)
# =============================================================================
#
# CSV policy: ignore CSVs by default; un-ignore committed API + fixture data.
# CI verifies the data/ exception — do not remove !data/**/*.csv
# See docs/GUARDRAILS.md and docs/adr/003-github-pages-static-api.md

*.csv
!data/**/*.csv
!tests/fixtures/**/*.csv

# Local scratch: Strategy B ZIP downloads, legacy roster archives (not for GitHub Pages)
src/texas_turnout_scraper/tmp/

# Session-local agent artifacts (not for version control)
.claude/handoffs/
HANDOFF.md
TASK.md

